# Avenora AI — Environment Variable Reference
#
# No runtime environment variables are currently required.
# This application is a pure client-side single-page application (SPA).
# All interactions, simulated telemetry, and modal flows operate entirely in the browser.
# The current application does not connect to or use external API endpoints (such as https://api.avenora.ai).
#
# Note for future development:
# If client-accessible environment variables are added in the future, Vite requires
# them to be prefixed with `VITE_` (e.g., `VITE_CUSTOM_SETTING=value`).
# Never place secret API keys, service tokens, or private credentials in VITE_ variables,
# as they will be bundled into client-side JavaScript and publicly visible.
